[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3298857961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110548#issuecomment-3298857961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110548","id":3298857961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EoJPp","user":{"login":"elmarhoppieland","id":114440420,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtI45A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114440420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland","html_url":"https://github.com/elmarhoppieland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T13:47:02Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T13:47:02Z","body":"I am getting a very similar error to this when I updated to 4.5, with the difference being that I get the error messages in the static variables of my plugins:\n```\nE 0:00:00:872   IconManagerPlugin.gd:8 @ @static_initializer(): Parameter \"SceneTree::get_singleton()\" is null.\n  <C++ Source>  scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp:491 @ parse_message()\n  <Stack Trace> IconManagerPlugin.gd:8 @ @static_initializer()\n```\nAfter removing a static variable, godot shows the error on a different static variable:\n```\nE 0:00:00:904   IconManager.gd:8 @ @static_initializer(): Parameter \"SceneTree::get_singleton()\" is null.\n  <C++ Source>  scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp:491 @ parse_message()\n  <Stack Trace> IconManager.gd:8 @ @static_initializer()\n```\nThe error always shows up exactly 8 times, both on my larger project and the mrp posted here. Even when adding more custom `StyleBox` classes, or static variables in my case, the error never shows more than 8 times.\n\nHowever, I have not been able to reproduce my specific case in a new project. This also means that I don't know if the error is specific to plugins or if it just happens to only show up in plugins in my case.\n\nLooking at the source code, we can see that godot used to return `ERR_UNCONFIGURED` without an error in 4.4.1:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/49a5bc7b616bd04689a2c89e89bda41f50241464/scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp#L102-L106\nBut now that code has been changed to throw an error in 4.5:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/876b290332ec6f2e6d173d08162a02aa7e6ca46d/scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp#L490-L491\nSo it's possible that the bug is older, it just didn't throw an error before.\n\nMy system info:\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6607) - AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX 370 w/ Radeon 890M (24 threads) - 15.11 GiB memory","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3298857961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3302471618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110548#issuecomment-3302471618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110548","id":3302471618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E17fC","user":{"login":"njamster","id":4141140,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNDExNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4141140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster","html_url":"https://github.com/njamster","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/njamster/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T11:04:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T11:04:39Z","body":"I ran into the same issue when upgrading my project to 4.5! However, in my case, the export variable is not part of a script extending a `StyleBox`, but the `Theme` itself. I can confirm that it happens exactly 8 times for me as well, and _only_ when it's set as the default theme in the project settings (switching themes at runtime doesn't produce those errors).\n\nFrom my tests, it doesn't seem to affect the final results, though: My theme still works fine! My best guess would be that the script runs _very_ early when there's no `SceneTree` existing yet (thus, the errors) but later again as well (thus, still works)? 🤔Also, the error messages won't appear in the exported version, only when running the project from within the editor. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3302471618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://