:"U_kgDOBtI45A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114440420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland","html_url":"https://github.com/elmarhoppieland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T19:59:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T19:59:47Z","body":"This is still happening in 4.6, but now the error shows exactly 10 times. Could be useful information for trying to determine where exactly the errors are coming from.\n\nBy the way, the pattern for this bug is that it seems to show up when code is run too early (I guess the debugger doesn't know what to do yet). The project's main theme is loaded very early into the game starting, and same thing goes for static initializers. So the issue likely isn't actually related to GUI but to the starting sequence creating the scene tree and parsing debug messages in the wrong order.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3807255509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5439412272","html_